{
  "name": "Social Media Agent - Dashboard Flow (Supabase + Claude)",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Setup after import\n\n**Credentials to select**\n- **Header Auth account** (webhooks + callbacks). Header name `x-api-key`, value = `N8N_WEBHOOK_API_KEY`. Set `N8N_CALLBACK_SECRET` in the dashboard to the same value.\n- **Anthropic account**: 3 Claude nodes\n- *Generate Image* uses n8n's free **Gateway credits** (OpenAI). Claude has no image output, so Claude writes the prompt and OpenAI renders it\n- **LinkedIn account**\n- **Facebook Graph account**: a **Page** access token with `pages_manage_posts`, `pages_read_engagement`, `instagram_basic`, `instagram_content_publish`\n\n**IDs to set** in *Normalize Publish Request*\n- `facebookPageId`\n- `instagramAccountId`: the Instagram *Business* Account ID, **not** the Page ID (`GET /{page-id}?fields=instagram_business_account`)\n\n**Storage**: no credential needed. The dashboard sends a one-off Supabase signed upload URL with each request.",
        "height": 700,
        "width": 460,
        "color": 6
      },
      "id": "eac6cf9c-90c9-5563-af3d-a172c99ee020",
